    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"mistake\" though. i can't just \"make amends\" for something that's already done. the damage is done and it's permanent. people look at me and i just feel like they're seeing the truth of what i am. i'm not looking for \"tools\" to deal with it. i just feel like there's no way to actually fix the fact that i ruined things for everyone. i'm just a net negative in the world now.",
